## Technologies Used

- **PlantUML**: Generates UML diagrams from text
- **plantuml-generator-util**: Java utility library for automatic diagram generation from source code
- Maven plugin: `exec-maven-plugin` for running the generator

## Integration with Maven Build

To automatically generate diagrams during the Maven build process, add the following to your `pom.xml`:

```xml
<plugin>
    <groupId>org.codehaus.mojo</groupId>
    <artifactId>exec-maven-plugin</artifactId>
    <version>3.1.0</version>
    <executions>
        <execution>
            <id>generate-plantuml-diagrams</id>
            <phase>compile</phase>
            <goals>
                <goal>java</goal>
            </goals>
            <configuration>
                <mainClass>com.springboot.MyTodoList.util.PlantUMLDiagramGenerator</mainClass>
            </configuration>
        </execution>
    </executions>
</plugin>
```

## Customization

To modify which components are included or change output locations, edit:
- `MtdrSpring/backend/src/main/java/com/springboot/MyTodoList/util/PlantUMLDiagramGenerator.java`

Update the `COMPONENTS` list to add, remove, or modify component configurations.

